WEBVTT

00:00:01.679 --> 00:00:05.799
Hey, this is Alec Lev, the producer of How We Made Your Mother.
嘿，我是亚历克·列夫 (Alec Lev)，《我们是如何塑造你的母亲》的制片人。

00:00:05.799 --> 00:00:10.359
We began our 14th episode this season with a voice note from Michaela.
我们以 Michaela 的语音留言开始了本季的第 14 集。

00:00:10.359 --> 00:00:14.439
That note ended with this very important question she had for her girlfriend.
这张便条以她向女友提出的一个非常重要的问题结束。

00:00:14.439 --> 00:00:24.320
Yeah, and I wanted to say to Carmina, you're good looking, you're funny, you're smart, now would you freaking marry me already?
是的，我想对卡米娜说，你很漂亮，你很有趣，你很聪明，现在你愿意嫁给我了吗？

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:30.679
A few weeks later, I got a follow up note from Michaela, which I surprised Josh and Craig with just the other day.
几周后，我收到了米凯拉的后续说明，前几天我对此感到惊讶。

00:00:30.679 --> 00:00:33.915
Hi guys, it's Michaela and Carmina here.
大家好，我是 Michaela 和 Carmina。

00:00:33.915 --> 00:00:37.880
We just wanted to fill you in about our proposal.
我们只是想向您介绍我们的建议。

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:40.577
Oh my god, oh my god, oh my god.
哦，我的上帝，哦，我的上帝，哦，我的上帝。

00:00:40.577 --> 00:00:42.600
Yes, very, very engaged.
是的，非常非常投入。

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.079
Making this such a legendary experience.
使这成为一次传奇的经历。

00:00:46.039 --> 00:00:54.840
Hemium has helped me throughout all of my chapters of my young adulthood, navigating my career, friendship, heart aches, and my love life.
Hemium 帮助我度过了我青年时期的所有章节，引导我的事业、友谊、心痛和爱情生活。

00:00:54.840 --> 00:01:05.331
One of my favorite quotes from Him Yim was should we hold out for the person who doesn't just tolerate our little quirks but actually kind of likes them.
我最喜欢的严谦的名言之一是，我们是否应该坚持不懈地对待那个不仅容忍我们的小怪癖而且实际上还喜欢它们的人。

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:10.062
And I am so lucky to have a person who loves all of my little quirks.
我很幸运有一个喜欢我所有小怪癖的人。

00:01:10.062 --> 00:01:16.920
I am forever grateful for Mikayla, my chosen family, and all of you who created this wonderful show.
我永远感谢米凯拉、我选择的家人以及所有创造了这个精彩节目的人。

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:17.463
Oh man.
噢，伙计。

00:01:17.463 --> 00:01:23.753
Thank you guys for being such an amazing part of my big grand ten Mosvie Gesture.
感谢你们成为我十大 Mosvie 手势中如此出色的一部分。

00:01:23.753 --> 00:01:36.798
It's been amazing to be able to propose like this and I'm forever grateful that we'll have this recording and we can look back on this and feel the love all over again.
能够像这样求婚真是太棒了，我永远感激我们能有这段录音，我们可以回顾这段经历，再次感受到爱。

00:01:36.798 --> 00:01:40.758
I really appreciate you guys and thank you so much.
我真的很感谢你们，非常感谢你们。

00:01:40.758 --> 00:01:43.010
We'll see you at the wedding.
我们婚礼上见。

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:44.485
Wow, it's the best.
哇，这是最好的。

00:01:44.485 --> 00:01:47.358
Oh my congratulations to both of you.
哦，我祝贺你们俩。

00:01:47.358 --> 00:01:55.900
That's amazing Ted Mosvie would be so proud of you and thank you for letting us be part of your grand gesture.
太棒了，泰德·莫斯维 (Ted Mosvie) 会为您感到骄傲，并感谢您让我们成为您宏伟举措的一部分。

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:57.620
We did not know Alec was gonna play that for us.
我们不知道亚历克会为我们演奏那首曲子。

00:01:57.620 --> 00:01:59.620
That was our first time hearing it.
那是我们第一次听到。

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:02.260
And it was a total, it's a wonderful surprise.
这真是一个美妙的惊喜。

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:06.700
